        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stainless Steel Flat Cap Glass Hole Cover</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid stainless steel, this 1\" outside diameter, double sided, hole filler will create a decorative element when covering an existing hole in glass such as a shower door or glass partition.  To install, put the bolt into one of the caps, place bolt through the hole and screw the second cap to the first. It is available in 2 finishes: Satin Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD-GHFX1 Cover:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Outside Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Hole Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Interior and Exterior Caps and Connecting Bolt</li>\r\n<li>Set-up For Back to Back Mounting</li>\r\n<li>Finishes: Satin Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
